Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "ConstructionZoneObstruction" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Large excavator bucket obstructing the lane" .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition ;
    :description "Clear daylight conditions" .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Heavy machinery encroaching into active driving lane" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Heavy machinery (excavator bucket) is positioned within the active driving lane, forcing a potential lane intrusion or emergency swerve.
Severity Score: 0.75